---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sources — August Edward Winter"
  description="Primary sources and family records behind the narrative of August Edward Winter."
>
  <section class="sources-page">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-header">
        <h1>Sources</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">
          This site is a careful reconstruction, not invention. The narrative
          rests on Winter’s own words and the memory kept by his family.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="source-grid">
        <article class="source-card card">
          <h2>Primary</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>August Edward Winter</strong> — published account (1899).
              His own recollection of the Minnesota missionary years, the
              winter journey west, ordination, marriage, and the upheavals of
              1862.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="source-card card">
          <h2>Background &amp; family</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Family background compiled by the daughter of August E. Winter
              (and related family papers), preserving the tone of daily life,
              devotion, and the generational line that followed.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="source-card card note">
          <h2>About this archive</h2>
          <p>
            Dates, places, and quotations are taken from those records. Story
            sections weave them into readable narrative while staying faithful
            to the sources. Where Winter’s own phrasing survives, it is given
            as direct quotation.
          </p>
          <p>
            The site is maintained as a living family and historical memorial—
            a place for the journey to remain visible.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .sources-page {
    padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .page-lead {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .source-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.15rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .source-card {
    padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .source-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .source-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.15rem;
  }

  .source-card li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .source-card p {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .source-card p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .source-card.note {
    background: rgba(124, 45, 18, 0.04);
  }
</style>
